node.doctext:
One contrived example, using a private config-val instead of a public package var.

<c>
my $config = 42;
my $change_allowed = 0;

sub mult {
  $_[0] * $config 
}

sub get_config {
   $config
}

sub set_config {
   $config = shift if  $change_allowed;
}

# yadda
</c><P>

of course you could also put only those subs inside an extra block together with the closure var.<P>



